OptionsPilot.spec

# PyInstaller output that was committed by mistake and untracked in V0.9.0-C7
# (3,238 files, ~97 MB of history). Two complete distributions plus a loose
# exe, all built against Python 3.14 while this project requires 3.12 — so
# every clone carried a stale binary beside source it no longer matched.
# Untracking does not shrink .git; the blobs stay in history until a
# deliberate rewrite (Decision D-4), which is out of scope here because it
# invalidates every existing clone, fork and open PR.
/_internal/
/dist_old/
/OptionsPilot.exe
/temp_inspect_history.py
/data/
/logs/
config.local.yaml
.pytest_cache/

# Coverage measurement output (V0.9.0-C4). The ratchet threshold lives in
# pyproject.toml; these are per-run artifacts and CI uploads coverage.xml
# as a build artifact rather than committing it.
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

.Rhistory

# Inno Setup installer build output
/installer/Output/
